%%label Movement IV
%%note G minor. The first movement's cycle returns with its mirrored arpeggios. The first violin climbs a scale to the top note of each chord, starting later each time and then filling the whole bar; the last cycle is quiet, the instruments leave one by one, and the viola ends as it began.
X:1
T:Glass’s Missing Quartet
T:Movement IV
C:Lor, in the manner of Philip Glass
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=104
%%score [v1 | v2 | va | vc]
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
K:Gm
V:v1
%%MIDI program 40
V:v2
%%MIDI program 40
V:va
%%MIDI program 41
V:vc
